config.gloamingforest.check_portal_placement=Check Portal Placement
config.gloamingforest.check_portal_placement.tooltip=Determines if new portals should be pre-checked for safety. If false, portals will fail to form rather than redirect to a safe alternate destination.~LINEBREAK~Note that disabling this also reduces the rate at which portal formation checks are performed.
config.gloamingforest.destructive_portal_lighting=Destructive Lightning
config.gloamingforest.destructive_portal_lighting.tooltip=Set this to false if you want the lightning that zaps the portal to not set things on fire. For those who don't like fun.
config.gloamingforest.dim_settings=Dimension Settings
config.gloamingforest.dim_settings.tooltip=Settings that are not reversible without consequences.
config.gloamingforest.disable_portal=Disable Portal Creation
config.gloamingforest.disable_portal.tooltip=Disable Gloaming Forest portal creation entirely. Provided for server operators looking to restrict action to the dimension.
config.gloamingforest.max_portal_size=Max Portal Size
config.gloamingforest.max_portal_size.tooltip=The max amount of water spaces the mod will check for when creating a portal. Very high numbers may cause performance issues.
config.gloamingforest.origin_dimension=Origin Dimension
config.gloamingforest.origin_dimension.tooltip=The dimension you can always travel to the Gloaming Forest from, as well as the dimension you will return to. Defaults to the overworld. (domain:regname).
config.gloamingforest.portal_for_new_player=Create Return Portal for Players
config.gloamingforest.portal_for_new_player.tooltip=If true, the return portal will spawn for new players that were sent to the Gloaming Forest if `newPlayersSpawnInGloaming` is true.
config.gloamingforest.portal_permission=Portal Creation Permission
config.gloamingforest.portal_permission.tooltip=Allows people with the specified permission or higher to create portals. This is based off of Vanilla's permission system.~LINEBREAK~You can read about them here: https://minecraft.wiki/w/Permission_level
config.gloamingforest.portal_return=Lock Return Portal
config.gloamingforest.portal_return.tooltip=If false, the return portal will require the activation item.
config.gloamingforest.portal_settings=Portal Settings
config.gloamingforest.portal_settings.tooltip=All settings regarding the Gloaming Forest Portal are found here
config.gloamingforest.portal_unlocked_by_advancement=Portal Unlock Advancement
config.gloamingforest.portal_unlocked_by_advancement.tooltip=Use a valid advancement resource location as a string. For example, using the string "minecraft:story/mine_diamond" will lock the portal behind the "Diamonds!" advancement. Invalid/Empty Advancement resource IDs will leave the portal entirely unlocked.
config.gloamingforest.portals_in_other_dimensions=Create Portals in Other Dimensions
config.gloamingforest.portals_in_other_dimensions.tooltip=Allow portals to the Gloaming Forest to be made outside of the 'origin' dimension. May be considered an exploit.
config.gloamingforest.spawn_in_gf=Spawn in Gloaming Forest
config.gloamingforest.spawn_in_gf.tooltip=If true, players spawning for the first time will spawn in the Gloaming Forest.
